title: Merchant_Meet
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>>
<<wait 2>>
<<picture YarnCommands merchant>>
<<fade_in YarnCommands 1>>
Merchant: Kihihi... Welcome, young lady.
Merchant: Here to buy somethin'? I got wares that might interest you.
<<open_shop_panel MerchantYarnCommands>>
===

title: merchant_heal
---
<<if is_full_health()>>
	<<jump merchant_health_full>>
<<elseif gold() >= 200>>
	<<change_gold -200>>
	<<change_health_percent 50>>
	Merchant: There. You look less dead already.
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_vigor
---
<<if gold() >= 150>>
	<<change_gold -150>>
	<<change_vigor 25>>
	Merchant: A little more strength for that fragile frame.
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_metabolism
---
<<if gold() >= 150>>
	<<change_gold -150>>
	<<change_metabolism 1>>
	Merchant: Your body will put those resources to better use now.
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_light
---
<<if light() >= 100>>
	<<jump merchant_light_full>>
<<elseif gold() >= 150>>
	<<change_gold -150>>
	<<change_light 10>>
	Merchant: There. A little more Light to guide you.
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_broke
---
Merchant: Come back when you can actually afford something.
===

title: merchant_light_full
---
Merchant: Your Light is already full. Even I cannot sell you more of it.
===

title: merchant_health_full
---
Merchant: You are already the definition of picture of health. Do not waste your Gold.
===

title: merchant_proficiency
---
<<if gold() >= 250>>
	<<change_gold -250>>
	<<change_proficiency 1>>
	Merchant: A sharper edge for a reasonable price.
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_insight
---
<<if gold() >= 150>>
	<<change_gold -150>>
	<<change_insight 1>>
	Merchant: Open your eyes, and the world will reveal more of itself.
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_affinity
---
<<if gold() >= 200>>
	<<change_gold -200>>
	<<change_affinity 2>>
